---
---
<html>
<body style="background-color:#000000">
<style>
  .perf-index {
    padding: 32px;
    font-family: monospace;
    max-width: 600px;
  }
  .perf-index h1 {
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .perf-index a {
    display: block;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    background: #1a1a2e;
    border: 1px solid #333;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: #0f0;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .perf-index a:hover {
    background: #2a2a4e;
    border-color: #555;
  }
  .perf-index .desc {
    color: #888;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
</style>

<div class="perf-index">
  <h1>Performance Test Routes</h1>
  <a href="/perf/ssr">
    SSR Only
    <div class="desc">Server render, no JS, no hydration. Measures renderToString + paint.</div>
  </a>
  <a href="/perf/hydrated">
    SSR + Hydration
    <div class="desc">Server render with client:load. Measures hydration wiring cost.</div>
  </a>
  <a href="/perf/client">
    Client Only
    <div class="desc">client:only, no SSR. Full client render from scratch.</div>
  </a>
</div>
</body>
</html>
